          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu muhiga gwa kaviri gwi liamiiha liu mwami Peka, muyaayi wa Remalia kuli mwami wa Isiraeli, Jozamu muyaayi wa Uzia yagwa mwami wi Ivuyuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naveeye ni mihiga sirini na tano. Jozamu yamiha mu Jerusalemi ku mihiga kumi na sita. Mama weve yaali Jerusa, mukaana wa Zadoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jozamu yakola malungi gukuyaanziza Yahova, nalondaa likora lilahi lia baba weve Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa havundu hu kusigamira misambwa sihononywa mba. Avandu vazizagilira kuhaana visiuviliru nu kusaamba vimuli ahene yaho. Yaali Jozamu uwaakola zinguru kwumbaka kirivwa cha ivaale chi Litembeli lia Yahova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
